  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Boil eggs: Preheat the grill to high. Line an oven tray with foil. Bring a small saucepan of water to the boil. Cook 2 eggs in the pan of boiling water for 6 mins for soft-boiled or 8 mins for hard-boiled. Drain, then cool in cold water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/461331/photos/large/73858_1-72d89bf47621b9d640e75bfcc09273d5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Meanwhile, trim and coarsely chop the lettuce. Thinly slice the avocado. Finely chop the capers (see Make it yours). Cut the haloumi and bread rolls into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/461332/photos/large/73858_2-f9669d5b2f81791fa7e819ce3cc198a5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grill haloumi and bread: Put the haloumi in a bowl, add a generous drizzle of olive oil and toss to coat. Put on the lined tray and grill for 4 mins. Put the bread in the same bowl, add a generous drizzle of olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Add the bread to the tray, turn the haloumi and grill for a further 4 mins or until the haloumi and bread are golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/461333/photos/large/73858_3-388f8f23a38a9cb6ec8a69e4b495b951.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make dressing: Combine the capers, mayonnaise, 1 tsp dijon mustard and 1 tsp white wine vinegar in a bowl. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/461334/photos/large/73858_4-25c7b95595328d630d5efaa836d0f0be.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Peel and halve the eggs. Divide the lettuce, avocado and egg among bowls. Top with the haloumi and croutons and drizzle with the caper dressing. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/461335/photos/large/73858_5-b9fd1f232960f3fe54a73b6f8ec4b548.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Not everyone loves capers. Simply leave them out of the dressing and serve them at the table (chopped or whole) if you prefer.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/461336/photos/large/73858_6-962dd0e7a4490d1b47039153748b1485.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
